      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks! This has helped to identify two more issues. One is that we didn't update the default bindings with a needed bind (you can fix that on your end) and another is a bug that requires the trigger to be pulled on the right hand for full fist (will require a patch from us). With the bind added, the left hand should be functioning as expected.\n\nTo fix the bindings, in the Global action set tab, on the grip, add a button control, and under \"touch\" add gesture_activator_grip for each hand",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
